        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: System updates pricing and ROI calculator across all channels (in-store kiosk, ecommerce, mobile app); generates updated sales collateral with revised savings estimates
Responsible (R): Pricing Analyst / IT
Accountable (A): Category Manager
Duration: 2–4 hours</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2529_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2529_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
