    <bpmn:process id="W_W2530" name="W2530. Solar Product Staff Training &amp; Certification" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: New product launch, new hire, or annual recertification
Frequency: Quarterly training sessions; annual recertification
Volume: ~400–600 solar-certified associates across 200 stores (2–3 per store)
Owner: Training Manager
Participants: Training Mgr, Category Manager, Solar Vendor Trainers, Sales Associates
Source: workflow W2530 — Solar Product Staff Training &amp; Certification</bpmn:documentation>
