        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-439 (ensure controlled execution — Solar Product Merchandising &amp; Consultation (PA-70.1).) | - operational: standard operating procedures; system-enforced validation rules
Owner: Marketing Manager — Category</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
